{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MINIMALIST STRATEGY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enjoy a minimalist, action-packed strategy game</strong> with simplified city building, upgrades, and troop management so you can focus more on tactical gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838160/extras/Fullmoon_siege_Fixed.gif?t=1744789643\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PICK YOUR FACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each faction offers <strong>distinct playstyles and unique heroes</strong>, resource management, troops, and upgrades. Counter your opponent with over 30 different unit types, or outsmart them by using the environment to your advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838160/extras/CC_Factions.jpg?t=1744789643\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead the Monceaux, <strong>a religious kingdom of knights and warriors.</strong> Their versatile troops, healing, and strong siege engines make them easy to pick up but hard to master.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the Fahad, <strong>a nomadic culture harnessing the power of the elements</strong>. Prepare to swing the game with fast, high-damage troops and impactful elementals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guide the URA, <strong>a republic of scientists and mechanics</strong>. They compensate for their lack of speed and protection with tactical superiority and pure firepower!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838160/extras/Fire_rain_fixed.gif?t=1744789643\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HANDCRAFTED CAMPAIGNS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enjoy a handcrafted campaign for each faction</strong>, with missions dedicated to their unique playstyle and troops. Guide a paranoid king, a lost shaman, and a grumpy general as they rampage over the lands with ever-changing alliances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838160/extras/Fahad_empire.gif?t=1744789643\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CHOOSE YOUR PLAYSTYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build your empire and set up your defences</strong>. Train a huge army to perform a powerful strike, raid your opponent with hit-and-run tactics, or level up your hero to become a one-man army!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838160/extras/CounterClashUra1.gif?t=1744789643\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Monceaux warmonger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2838160/040884be9bcfe94906d70d5aa46f74482192f069.jpg"},{"name":"Fahad warmonger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2838160/48e9c948d161c444cc7ce3b17a9bd799fa5f9768.jpg"},{"name":"URA warmonger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2838160/cfe74c3becb16726829e496dd3b138837d689b1d.jpg"},{"name":"Reunited at last!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2838160/3070b85c2eca4c39be8579d6f509d26f6c72185e.jpg"},{"name":"Earth, Wind, and Fire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2838160/ece59f639df8e5d0a88c8781aa06234d01163222.jpg"},{"name":"Monceaux expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2838160/d718dd992dcbbf153de441c8500a3e3ea760488b.jpg"},{"name":"Fahad expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2838160/331e90177af7da28f76fe56e0f3e1cbe8516ff6a.jpg"},{"name"