t to your advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838160/extras/CC_Factions.jpg?t=1744789643\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead the Monceaux, <strong>a religious kingdom of knights and warriors.</strong> Their versatile troops, healing, and strong siege engines make them easy to pick up but hard to master.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the Fahad, <strong>a nomadic culture harnessing the power of the elements</strong>. Prepare to swing the game with fast, high-damage troops and impactful elementals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guide the URA, <strong>a republic of scientists and mechanics</strong>. They compensate for their lack of speed and protection with tactical superiority and pure firepower!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838160/extras/Fire_rain_fixed.gif?t=1744789643\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HANDCRAFTED CAMPAIGNS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enjoy a handcrafted campaign for each faction</strong>, with missions dedicated to their unique playstyle and troops. Guide a paranoid king, a lost shaman, and a grumpy general as they rampage over the lands with ever-changing alliances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838160/extras/Fahad_empire.gif?t=1744789643\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CHOOSE YOUR PLAYSTYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build your empire and set up your defences</strong>. Train a huge army to perform a powerful strike, raid your opponent with hit-and-run tactics, or level up your hero to become a one-man army!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838160/extras/CounterClashUra1.gif?t=1744789643\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Bjenssen"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838160/0e1e150166b1384b483439608db9e10b013375e4/header.jpg?t=1744789643","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257050979,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257050979/movie480.mp4?t=1744620960","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257050979/movie_max.mp4?t=1744620960"},"name":"Counter Clash - Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257050979/ef185ab370f0a5567584b62ab7f434733bf89780/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744620960","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257050979/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744620960","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257050979/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744620960"}}],"name":"Counter Clash","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Counter Clash - $10.99 USD","packageid":1012791,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":1099}],"title":"Buy Counter Clash"}],"packages":[1012791],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core I5 4460 3.20 Ghz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 5500 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><str